{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32260","headline":"秘书省有贺监知章草题诗笔力遒健风尚高远拂尘寻玩因有此作 · 温庭筠","name":"秘书省有贺监知章草题诗笔力遒健风尚高远拂尘寻玩因有此作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"越溪渔客贺知章，任达怜才爱酒狂。\n鸂鶒苇花随钓艇，蛤蜊菰菜梦横塘。\n几年凉月拘华省，一宿秋风忆故乡。\n荣路脱身终自得，福庭回首莫相忘。\n出笼鸾鹤归辽海，落笔龙蛇满坏墙。\n李白死来无醉客，可怜神彩吊残阳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32260.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32260","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}